  "prefLabel": "Ed 602.02 Evaluation Requirements",
  "priorExpiration": "1996-06-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 602.02 Evaluation Requirements. Each institution that offers one or more PEPPs shall have in place an assessment system and continuous improvement data cycle that evaluates the curriculum, clinical practice and partnerships, and resources for the institution’s PEPP that enable the oversight and coordination for the preparation of effective educators as described in Ed 607 and relevant sections of Ed 608.\n\nSource. #2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84, EXPIRED 5-16-90\n\nNew. #4851, eff 6-25-90; EXPIRED 6-25-96\n\nNew. #6366, eff 10-30-96; ss and moved by #8194, eff 10-26-04 (formerly Ed 602.01); ss by #10295, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13747, eff 9-16-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed600.html"
